hs of contraction. Despite the encouraging industrial figures, the overall economic outlook remains uncertain, with Italy’s GDP shrinking by 0.1% in the second quarter and the government maintaining a 0.6% growth forecast for 2025 amid global trade uncertainties."}],"$L13","$L14"]}]}],"$L15"]}]]}]}],"$L16"]}]}]]
